                              <h4>Wayanad-trip-with-family</h4>
                              <p>While there are several best resorts in Wayanad for family, there are also many resorts in Wayanad that provide an intimate and romantic escape for couples.</p>
                              <p>Whether you are looking for a family vacation or a romantic retreat, Wayanad has something for everyone. Known for its pristine natural beauty, Wayanad offers a wide range of activities and attractions that cater to every age group. From trekking through lush green forests to exploring ancient temples and experiencing local culture, there's something for everyone in Wayanad.</p>
                              <p>Wayanad, a scenic district nestled in the Western Ghats of Kerala, is a popular tourist destination for families looking for a rejuvenating vacation amidst nature. A Wayanad trip with family is the perfect getaway from the hustle and bustle of city life. The district is dotted with numerous luxurious resorts that offer a perfect blend of comfort, luxury, and serenity.</p>
                              <p>There are several<a href="honeymoon-holiday-resort-wayanad.php">couple-friendly resorts in Wayanad</a>that offer a perfect blend of comfort, luxury, and serenity that families look for in a vacation. Among these resorts, Kuruva Island Resort and Spa stand out for its unique location and luxurious amenities.</p>
                              <p>Located on the banks of the Kabini river, Kuruva Island Resort and Spa is an ideal destination for families looking for a peaceful and rejuvenating vacation. Spread over 2 acres of lush greenery, this resort offers a perfect blend of modern amenities and traditional Kerala architecture. The resort is located just a few kilometres away from the famous Kuruva Island, which is a popular tourist attraction in Wayanad.</p>
                              <p>The resort features 20 well-appointed rooms and cottages that are designed to provide a comfortable and luxurious stay for families. The rooms are spacious and equipped with all modern amenities like air conditioning, LED TV, minibar, and tea/coffee maker. The cottages, on the other hand, offer a more rustic and traditional experience, with thatched roofs and open verandahs that offer breathtaking views of the surrounding greenery.</p>
                              <p>The resort also features a wide range of facilities and activities that cater to every member of the family. For kids, the resort has a dedicated play area and a swimming pool. The resort also offers indoor and outdoor games like table tennis, carrom, and badminton. For adults, the resort offers a well-equipped fitness centre, a spa that offers traditional Ayurvedic treatments, and a multi-cuisine restaurant that serves delicious local and international dishes.</p>
                              <p>One of the main attractions of the resort is its proximity to Kuruva Island. This uninhabited island is located in the middle of the Kabini river and is a popular tourist destination in Wayanad. The island is known for its pristine natural beauty, with dense forests, crystal clear streams, and a wide variety of flora and fauna. Visitors can take a boat ride from the resort to the island and spend a day exploring its beauty.</p>
                              <p>Apart from Kuruva Island, there are several other attractions in Wayanad that families can explore during their stay at Kuruva Island Resort and Spa. The Edakkal Caves, located about 25 kilometres from the resort, is an ancient site with prehistoric carvings and paintings. The Banasura Sagar Dam, located about 20 kilometres from the resort, is another popular tourist spot that offers breathtaking views of the surrounding hills.</p>
                              <p>In conclusion, Wayanad is a perfect destination for families looking for a relaxing and fun-filled vacation. Kuruva Island Resort and Spa offers an ideal accommodation option for families, with its unique location, luxurious amenities, and a wide range of activities and attractions that cater to every member of the family. When it comes to planning a Wayanad trip with family the choice of accommodation plays a crucial role in making your vacation enjoyable and memorable. So, we are `, Kuruva Island Resort and Spa should definitely be on your list of places to stay.</p>
